    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔ̱th Je-kɔb kɛ gan Jo-thɛp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kɛl cua Jo-thɛp ben jiök i̱, “Nɛn ɛ, guur täämɛ li̱wɛ.” Ɛ jɛn, cuɛ gaatkɛ da̱ŋ rɛw ni Ma-na-thɛ kɛnɛ Ɛ-pa-rim cu naŋ kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ca Je-kɔb jiök i̱. “Ci gatdu ni Jo-thɛp ji̱ ben gui̱l,” cuɛ rɔ kok kɛ buɔ̱m kä cuɛ rɔ jiac nyuur wi̱i̱ dhaŋä dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ Jo-thɛp jiök i̱, “Ci Kuoth in le̱ny buɔ̱mdɛ ti diaal rɔ nyuɔ̱th ɣä mëë ta̱a̱ wec in cɔal i̱ Luudh ro̱o̱l Kɛ-naan, kä ɛn thɔ̱ŋi i̱ cɛ ɣä poth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cɛ ɣä jiök i̱, ‘Ɣän bä kuayku re̱p kɛ ɣöö bi gaatku a döör ti nyin ŋuan kä bä mun ɛmɛ ka̱m kuayku tin ba gua̱a̱thdu guäl ala duŋdiɛn mi do̱raar.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ lɛni jiök i̱, “Jo-thɛp, gatdä, gaatku da̱ŋ rɛw tin ci di̱eth ro̱o̱l I-jëp mëë /ka̱n ni ben, cä kɛ mat. Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Ma-na-thɛ akɛ a gaatkä ce̱tnikɛ gatdä ni Rɛ-u-ben kɛnɛ gatdä ni Cim-on. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gaat tin bi di̱eth kɛ kɔriɛn bikɛ la nyinku kä ba kɛ ciöl dämani ni Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Ma-na-thɛ kɛ kui̱ bo̱thnikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La̱tdä jɛ inɔ kɛ ɣöö mëëdan ëë luɔ̱nyä jɔk kä Pa-dan, cu lɔcdä jiääk ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö muɔɔr ni Re-cɛl cɛ li̱w jäl rɛy rööl Kɛ-naan mëë cakɔ Ɛp-rath ŋäthikä kä mi tɔt. Cua jɛ kony dup wäkäda Ɛp-rath min mɔ Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm täämɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ gaat Jo-thɛp da̱ŋ rɛw nɛn, cuɛ thi̱ec i̱, “Kä dho̱o̱li ti̱ti̱ kɛ ŋaani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Jo-thɛp gua̱n jiök i̱, “Kɛ kɛn gaatkä tëë ci Kuoth kɛ ka̱m ɣä ɛn wi̱c ɛ.” Ɛ jɛn cu I-thɛ-rɛl cu wee i̱, “Ku kɛ mal ni nööŋ thiekä kɛ ɣöö deekɛ ben poth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ I-thɛ-rɛl cɛ nyinkɛ ti̱l kɛ ɣöö ci dɔŋdɛ di̱t, kä /cɛ ne̱n agɔaa. Inɔ, cu Jo-thɛp gaatkɛ cu ti̱ec gua̱n kä cu gua̱n kɛ ciɛm kä kuakɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ Jo-thɛp jiök i̱, “Ɣän /cä jɛ ŋäc ɛn ɣöö dëë ji̱ nyɔk kɛ nën, kä täämɛ Kuoth cɛ ɣä jak kä mi nɛ̈ɛ̈nä ji̱ amäni gaatku bä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-thɛp kɛ cu woc nhiam Je-kɔb kä cuɛ rɔ goŋ nhiam gua̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-thɛp kɛ nyɔk kɛ ti̱c jɛ kääpɛ Ɛ-pa-rim kɛ tet cuëëcdɛ min lot ni tet caam I-thɛ-rɛl, kä te Ma-na-thɛ tetdä caamdɛ min lot ni cuec I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ ɣöö Ma-na-thɛ ɛ jɛn gat in kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä I-thɛ-rɛl, min cɛ kɛ lɔ̱m kɛ te̱tkɛ, cuɛ te̱tkɛ gua̱c kä cuɛ tet cuëëcdɛ la̱th wi̱i̱ Ɛ-pa-rim cäŋɛ min kuiy ni jɛn, kä cuɛ camdɛ la̱th wi̱i̱ Ma-na-thɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Je-kɔb Jo-thɛp poth wëë i̱, “A dho̱li ti̱ti̱ ba poth ɛ Kuoth ëë ci gua̱a̱ri bo̱th rɛy lätnikiɛn. Jɛn Kuoth ëë ci ɣä tit ni mëë pay ɣä dap amäni täämɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä akɛ puɔthkɛ ɛ jääk Kuɔth Nhial ëë ci ɣä kän rɛy rikni diaal kɛ ɣöö dëë kɛ ciöl ɣä kɔnɛ gua̱a̱ri ni A-bɛ-ram kɛnɛ Ay-dhɛk, kä a thuk duëlikiɛn rëpkɛ rɔ̱ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Jo-thɛp ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ci gua̱n tet cuëëcdɛ la̱th wi̱i̱ Ɛ-pa-rim cu ca̱rɛ jiääk ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä cuɛ tet gua̱n käp ɛ jɛn i̱ de̱rɛ woc wi̱i̱ Ɛ-pa-rim kä de̱rɛ jɛ kuëŋ wi̱i̱ Ma-na-thɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ wee i̱, “/Ci ɛ jɛn guä, gat in kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ jɛn ɛn, läthni tet cuëëcdu wi̱i̱dɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gua̱n jɛ lo̱k wëë i̱, “Ɛpuc ŋa̱cä jɛ, gatdä. Ɛn puɔ̱nydɛ Ma-na-thɛ bɛ la do̱r mi di̱i̱t bä, kuɛ la ɣöö bi gurɛ jɛ le̱ny kä bi kuaykɛ dööri ti ŋuan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ cu poth ɛn cäŋ ɔ wëë i̱, “Döör gan I-thɛ-rɛl diaal bikɛ rɔ̱ poth kɛ ciöötkun, a Kuoth jak ji̱ kä bi ce̱tkɛ Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Ma-na-thɛ.” Cuɛ Ɛ-pa-rim ka̱m di̱t inɔ kɛ nhiam kä Ma-na-thɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu I-thɛ-rɛl Jo-thɛp cu jiök i̱, “Täämɛ ɣän cä thia̱k kɛ lia̱a̱, kuɛ la ɣöö bi Kuoth te kɛɛl kɛ yɛ kä bɛ yɛ luɔc mun guurikun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱du cä Cɛ-kɛm ma̱t ji̱ ala duŋdu, ɛn dhɔr ëë macä kä ji̱ Ɛ-mor kɛ thɛpdä kɛnɛ kui̱n kui̱ndä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
